extends RefCounted
const GUIDE := "Carry a knife: the bond will not break for an empty hand. Read these words and the Power will wake at the far end of the chamber. Take it. Touch any rune and the Hound will hunt you until this visit ends.\n\nPress Y within 192 paces of the Hound to lay a Blood Trap. It takes forty drops of life (40 HP), leaving you alive, and binds the beast for eighteen seconds. While it is bound, approach it and press E to set the trap and drop the Power. Q also places the Power when you stand at the trap. Keep the knife in your bag. A failed attempt spends nothing.\n\nIf you cannot finish it, the Flee and Remain runes each demand twenty unbroken seconds holding E. Moving, releasing E, injury or confirmed detection breaks the hold. Flee opens the way outside. Remain returns you to the beginning, under the house's old Loop rules."
